    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Add your Wisdom modifier to the damage you deal with any Cleric cantrip.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-bDHa7ClHZ3YPWKvs\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This bonus damage is not automatically included in your cantrips.</p><p>You can add [[lookup @abilities.wis.mod]] to the Situational Bonus field of your cantrip's damage rolls or you can permanently add it to your cantrips by adding \"@abilities.wis.mod\" (minus the quotes) in the Bonus field.</p><p>Alternatively, the <strong>Damage</strong> activity on this feature includes your Wisdom modifier and allows you to choose the damage type in the roll's dialog box.</p></section>",
